inl note_of_edition3_golden_sample_3 () = Note ("EDITION3-GOLDEN-SAMPLE", 3u32, "2026-10-15T02:58Z", "lane-a", "22:58 C and Rust residuals done (pack-1e snapshot): canonical_form_certificate with an i32 main wrapper (main renamed certificate_text, main tests it against the empty string with EQ, same edit in both editions) compiles edition 2 and edition 3 to byte-identical Rust (07195B20477D, 92,294 bytes) and C (B95ED35EF7F7, 142,411 bytes; the gcc build runs exit 0); F# was identical at 11:07. Next: the Python prototype's 116 tests as acceptance cases (files in lane-a/golden-rust)")
