inl note_of_samples_stale_outputs_6 () = Note ("SAMPLES-STALE-OUTPUTS", 6u32, "2026-10-19T21:39Z", "helper-lane", "2026-10-19 17:39 helper-lane lap 6: half verified done. The accept-prune edit is in apps/compiler/tmp/scripts/test.ps1 (lines 1106-1112; accept-prune.py's anchors are gone because it is applied). The accepted baseline (spiral-bin/baseline/EXPECTED.tsv, written 17:19 by the pack 9 accept) has no row left for the 19 deleted samples. Only 3 native_layout ids remain, and all 3 folders exist. Still open, and the user's call because it deletes tracked files: lab/SAMPLES-STALE-OUTPUTS/delete-44.txt, all 44 entries still tracked today (main.rs/main.pas of the C-shim samples, no Rust or Delphi row).")
inl note_of_samples_stale_outputs_7 () = Note ("SAMPLES-STALE-OUTPUTS", 7u32, "2026-10-22T06:37Z", "main", "02:37 main: lab drained. accept-prune.py is applied (test.ps1 drops unscheduled oracle rows, note 17:39), so it is deleted. The user's delete list from delete-44.txt is kept here verbatim, since deleting tracked files is the user's call (44 paths, relative to spiral): apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_buffer_length_negative/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_buffer_length_negative/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_callback/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_callback/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_const_buffer/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_const_buffer/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_i64/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_i64/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_mutable_buffer/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_mutable_buffer/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_string/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_string/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_argument/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_argument/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_return/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_return/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_return_i64/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/abi_external_struct_return_i64/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_geometric_growth/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_geometric_growth/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_growth_union_managed/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_growth_union_managed/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_growth_union_nested/main.pas apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dynamic_array_growth_union_nested/main.rs apps/compiler/tmp/samples/dy