, UPSTREAM-CHANGES-POST, UPSTREAM-POST-1-VANILLA, CI-OFFLOAD, TODO-AS-SOURCE -> next: drive: SPIRAL-CLI test-blocks job (queued in the gate) | lap 22 19:40 (subagent2): lap 22 pass: external state unchanged (no push or CI run since 02:48; deps PIPELINES-GREEN 35, EOIE-MACHINE-WINDOWS 0, KINO-WITHOUT-ELIXIR 10, GADT-JOIN-POINT-GROWING-INDEX 0), so the blocked items keep their next steps (SIM-IN-SPIRAL, TREE-PAGES-EVERY-REPO, WORKFLOW-END-TO-END, CELLS-GATE-MACHINE-WINDOW, MEGA-SAMPLES-TOGETHER, ZED-TEST-RUNNABLES, TREE-SITTER-SPIRAL, UPSTREAM-*); since lap 21 grains landed on LEAN-BACKEND (boxed closures), CALYX-BACKEND (i64 probe + stack-candidate), OPENQASM3-BACKEND (ts_int_wrap probe), TODO-AS-SOURCE (1 MiB harvest limit), CI-OFFLOAD (gate-time census + cells-gate-ci.ps1), KINO-HOT-PATHS (bounded warm probe); SPIRAL-CLI test-blocks job still waiting in the gate (27 min) -> next: next bounded job: warm-probe-run or cells-gate-ci on one file once the gate frees | lap 23 20:12 (subagent2): lap 23 pass: grains since lap 22 on KINO-HOT-PATHS (warm profile measured, 40), SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR (cli_common blocks passed; crates job 2 queued), CELLS-PROBES (probe.py), CELLS-NEW-PROJECT (probe.ps1), ZED-TEST-RUNNABLES (query 416/416), GLEAM-JS-TARGET-GAPS (maths 2.0.2 still latest), LEAN-BACKEND (doc note), CALYX-BACKEND (union census; stack-frames dropped from stack-candidate per main), SPIRAL-INDEPENDENT (stack-frames parked), TODO-AS-SOURCE (limit routed to git-0e); unchanged and blocked: SIM-IN-SPIRAL, TREE-PAGES-EVERY-REPO, WORKFLOW-END-TO-END, CELLS-GATE-MACHINE-WINDOW, MEGA-SAMPLES-TOGETHER, TREE-SITTER-SPIRAL, UPSTREAM-CHANGES-POST, UPSTREAM-POST-1-VANILLA, RUST-NIGHTLY-EVERYWHERE, EBPF-C-PROFILE, OPENQASM3-BACKEND, CI-OFFLOAD, LIB-USAGE-DIAGNOSTICS, CELLS-EVERYWHERE -> next: crate test blocks job, then cells-gate-ci on one file | lap 24 20:46 (subagent2): lap 24 = end-of-day dry-run sweep after pack 12 touched spiral_compiler.fs (20:33): int_widths 7, subword_codegen 4, EBPF subword 4, boxed_closures 5, subword_sim 11 (run.py) anchors still match once; the 3 AGENTS.md notes, probe.py, patched_mounts.py, console_c_arm.py, lean-stable.py, dice-drop-common.py, drop-polyglot-fallbacks.py and promote.ps1 all dry-run clean; new since lap 23: CI-OFFLOAD cells-gate-ci checked locally (40), KINO-HOT-PATHS fixed-cost split (BEAM+mix boot ~5.8 s median under load) -> next: stop row | lap 24-stop 21:10 (subagent2): resume point: laps 19-24 done (lap 18 had ended at 18:15). Moved to 90/70/40: UPSTREAM-POST-1-VANILLA 90 (post-gate passed; where the post lives and the PR are the user's call), SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR 70 (7/7 crate test blocks green; promote.ps1 adds ///> _ above Export main), KINO-HOT-PATHS 40 (warm profile: Kino CPU about 22 ms per cell, warm overhead mostly waiting), CI-OFFLOAD 40 (cells-gate-ci.ps1 works locally). Staged for main (all dry-run by default, all-or-nothing writes, refuse a re-apply): stack-candidate.ps1 (int_widths.py, subword_codegen.py, EBPF subword.py, boxed_closures.py: tomorrow's first pack per main), subword_sim.py (run.py shim, its own review), agents-note.py x2 + agents-widths.py (docs), probe.py (--probe) + scaffold probe.ps1, patched_mounts.py/patched-mounts-run.ps1 (byte-exact restores), 6 CELLS-EVERYWHERE runners (byte restores; mapm/backend blocks fixed with open testing, rerun rows 30/38), pin-stale.py (--run single-flight-20261019-161549), SPIRAL-INDEPENDENT applies (dice + alphabet go). Parked: stack-frames.py (gpt5parallel side). Routed: the eoie todos 1 MiB limit to git-0e. Lab cleanup: 4 Done folders zipped to spiral-bin/backups/lab-done-lane2-20261019-1948.zip, then deleted -> next: next session: Calyx non-recursive unions (30 samples), Kino phase timings per cell, Lean probe of the 2 boxed-closure samples after the pack | lap 24-stop-b 21:21 (subagent2): final resume point (supersedes 24-stop): KINO-HOT-PATHS is now 50. A fresh warm 10-cell gate takes about 5.1 s: 2.2 s BEAM and mix boot, 2.0 s